            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Nivi 0.2.1

A maintenance release. Nothing you use has changed.

- Nivi is built with the build tools that come with macOS 27.
- The app no longer carries leftover build information, so the download is smaller.

This build is signed by its author rather than by Apple, so the first launch
needs one extra step. See INSTALL.md.
]]></description>
